To formally become a trustee you'll need to be voted in at an AGM, which we hold each autumn.

If you're interested, just email us at [contact@meadowbrookdartington.org](mailto:contact@meadowbrookdartington.org) with a little about yourself and how you'd like to help. We'll get back to you and can share your details with the other attendees ahead of the AGM.

## Come and meet us

The easiest way to get to know the trustees is to come along to something. Check the [events calendar](/calendar) for what's coming up, including:

- **DRA socials**: an informal get-together at Meadowbrook on the last Thursday of each month, from 7pm
- **The AGM**: open to everyone, and where new trustees are voted in
- **Community workdays**: practical days improving the buildings and grounds, whenever one is scheduled

You can also read more [about the DRA](/about), including minutes from previous meetings.
